flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A[/On the Profile page the member<br/>types the current password<br/>and the new one twice/]
  R1((1)) --> A
  A --> B{Current<br/>typed?}
  B -->|No| B1[/Type your current<br/>password first/] --> R2((1))
  B -->|Yes| C{New one strong<br/>and matching?}
  C -->|No| C1[/Show the rule<br/>or the mismatch/] --> R3((1))
  C -->|Yes| D[PUT /api/profile/password<br/>with the token cookie]
  D --> E{Cookie<br/>good?}
  E -->|No| E1[/401: please log in first/] --> X([End])
  E -->|Yes| F{Current password<br/>right?}
  F -->|No| F1[/400: your current<br/>password is wrong/] --> R4((1))
  F -->|Yes| G{New one passes<br/>the rule?}
  G -->|No| G1[/400: use at least 8 characters,<br/>with a number or a symbol/] --> R5((1))
  G -->|Yes| H[Hash it with bcrypt<br/>and save the user]
  H --> I[/Your password is changed,<br/>the fields are cleared/] --> X
